348fa7fa029","name":"zhang-junming21","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/aa/ad/a482aad93ee6a7df064194c83e22353ea06f82b6f0e62d9533b1656a04c03194.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/hid54649903"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166605937,"discussion_id":"9d527e06b53aab04160e6d65a1b78bdf29253feb","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-27T14:40:18+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-27T14:40:18+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166605979,"discussion_id":"f53a47eca909bdeee2e520ed256ad77d1a7c9c92","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复批量矩阵乘法算子中，当输入张量A采用NZ（非零）格式存储时，计算其内存偏移量（`offsetA_`）的逻辑错误。该错误导致在批量维度上误用了张量B的偏移变量（`batchBOffset`），可能引发数据访问错位，进而导致计算结果错误或程序异常。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在`CalcOffset`函数中，针对输入张量A为NZ格式的两种情况（转置与非转置），将计算批量维度偏移时使用的变量从`batchBOffset`统一更正为`batchAOffset`。此修改确保了在访问张量A的全局内存时，能够根据其自身的批量索引（`batchA_`）正确计算偏移，从而保证数据读取的准确性。","created_at":"2026-03-27T14:40:32+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-27T14:40:32+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166606093,"discussion_id":"e36c61cc47fea2e62c5ff69fcc49a4fb9b9a5561","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=b582e6c0e2c54a3f8168601c5b292c24&pipelineRunId=637bdb9aeab2471baef9abe07c19be3c&projectName=CANN'>637bdb9aeab2471baef9abe07c19be3c</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blo